    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-262073907": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1878605931,
   "children": [
    1066747449,
    1201229823,
    -1806320126,
    1353827081
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You really trust her to keep her word?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1066747449": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -262073907,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Yeah… I’ve thought about that too.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-910832754": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 238665456,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Pfft—not a chance. Just because we’re not at war doesn’t mean I wanna braid each other’s hair and talk about feelings.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1772806627": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -687177205,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Damn right I will. If she thinks she can hold her throne without dirty tricks, let’s see how long she lasts.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "101103978": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -687177205,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This fight is mine to win now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-403868756": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 238665456,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Though, if we did have lunch, I bet she’d order some tiny-ass salad and pretend it’s filling.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1201229823": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -262073907,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Celeste isn’t the type to just give up. Even if she’s playing fair now, she’s always thinking ten steps ahead.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1806320126": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -262073907,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But that’s fine. I don’t want an easy win. I want a real one.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1353827081": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -262073907,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And when I take that top spot, she won’t have any excuses.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
